OL,3,GNEWSAThree more held in post-crash
OL,4,Acrime crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree more arrests have been made as
OL,7,Fpart of a wider police operation
OL,8,Fagainst organised crime, following a
OL,9,Fhead-on car crash that left two police
OL,10,Fofficers and five young people dead.
OL,12,FTwo of the arrested men, aged 19 and
OL,13,F24, were held after one vehicle rammed
OL,14,Fanother in Derwentwater Road, between
OL,15,FGrangetown and Eston near
OL,16,FMiddlesbrough, at about 23:00 BST on
OL,17,FSunday, Cleveland Police said.
OL,19,FAn 18-year-old man arrested in
OL,20,Fconnection with another suspected
OL,21,Fmotoring offence in the town has now
OL,22,Fbeen charged with dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
